# presto-pay-sdk

Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for full context before non-trivial edits.

**Hard constraints**

- Java 8 only; **no runtime Maven dependencies** (JUnit test scope only).
- Public API: `com.prestouniverse.pay` except **`internal`** — never expose internal types to integrators.
- Payment wire codes: **`String` constants** in holder classes (`PaymentStatus`, `PaymentMethod`, `TxnType`, `ErrorCode`); responses use `String`, not Java enums.
- Operations named `*Request`; package-private `toJson`/`fromJson` on payment DTOs.
- **`mvn verify`** must pass (Checkstyle + tests) before finishing work.
- Preserve init/reverse/refund idempotency: retry only when transport reports `requestNotSent()`; document duplicate `txnRefNum` / use `query` for reconciliation.

**Contract changes:** align with README and contract tests; update CHANGELOG when behavior is user-visible.
